The Story:
The town of Wolvespine has made a shocking discovery : some of the villagers are secretly Werewolves and sometimes even other dark creatures. The regular Townsfolk must try to eliminate these Werewolves. Can they manage to get rid of the Werewolves before they’re all eaten alive?
The Objective:
The Werewolves: Each night, the Werewolves choose one Townsfolk to murder. During the day, they try to conceal their identity from the Townsfolk. If they eliminate all Townsfolk, they win.
The Townsfolk: Each night, one of them is killed by the Werewolves. This player is eliminated from the game. The next morning, survivors gather in the town square and try to discover who the Werewolves are. After discussing and debating, everyone votes to lynch a suspect, who is then eliminated from the game. If they eliminate all Werewolves, they win.
For more advanced players, there’s a whole new world of Solo and Unaligned villagers with unique and new objectives.
